## Where this stands in the work

The substance nodes of `docs/preventable-death-at-scale.md` each carry a receptor, a mechanism and a
measured affinity, which are the relations above: μ-opioid agonism, transporter reversal, 5-HT2A agonism.
That document's finding that gabapentin's share of overdose deaths is a floor because it is not on the
standard postmortem panel is a statement about what the toxicology observation warrants. Its `links:` lines
are typed edges written in prose because the typed object did not exist, and its marking of Claude's gloss
against a sourced claim is a provenance distinction that belongs in a type. So this construction is the
substrate that record already stands on.

